---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionTitle from '../components/SectionTitle.astro';
import { url } from '../lib.js';

const levels = ['Diamond', 'Platinum', 'Gold', 'Silver', 'Bronze'];
const photos = [
  'Attendees filling the sponsor hall at Devoxx Greece',
  'The sponsor hall at the Megaron during a break',
  'Attendees talking in the sponsor area',
  'A crowded sponsor hall between sessions',
].map((alt, i) => ({ src: `/images/sponsorships/hall-${i + 1}.jpg`, alt }));
---
<Base title="Sponsorships" current="Sponsors" description="Sponsor Devoxx Greece 2027: packages, booths and how to get involved.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionTitle caption="Each year we welcome amazing companies who want to show their support for the developer community" title="Sponsorships" level="h1" />
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p>Sponsorships come in five main forms: Diamond, Platinum, Gold, Silver and Bronze, with a maximum number of slots available at each level.</p>
          <p>We also offer premium bolt-ons for some sponsorship levels, and a range of à la carte options for sponsors at all levels.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>Sponsors are provided with a shell-scheme booth space, info desks, and stools. Sponsors can choose to brand the shell scheme directly, bring their own pop-up booth, or create a custom-built booth within the space provided.</p>
          <p>Our sponsors choose their position on the exhibition floor, with space allocated on a first-come, first-served basis. Therefore, the first company to sign at the Gold level gets first choice of a Gold booth position.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="pills">
        {levels.map((l) => <li>{l}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <ul class="gallery">
        {photos.map((p) => <li><img src={url(p.src)} alt={p.alt} loading="lazy" /></li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-grey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="callout">
        <h2>Become a sponsor</h2>
        <p>If your company would like to support Devoxx Greece, or you want to find out more, drop an email to <a href="mailto:pat@devoxx.gr">pat@devoxx.gr</a> to send you back the detailed sponsoring document.</p>
        <p>When a sponsorship is agreed upon, we’ll prepare a contract for signing.</p>
        <p>Once confirmed, we’ll announce your presence at the event, provide all the info you need, and set-up calls to guide your team through all of the next steps.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="mailto:pat@devoxx.gr">Email pat@devoxx.gr</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
